{"Duplicate index builds allowed: bleveBackend.BuildIndex no longer holds cacheMu across the build, so concurrent callers building the same key can both build separate indexes and then race to store into b.cache (last writer wins), wasting work, leaving one built index untracked, and for file-backed indexes can cause concurrent creation/writes to the same directory": 0.8823069930076599, "TotalDocs map race panic: searchSupport.init calls s.search.TotalDocs() after starting a WatchWriteEvents goroutine; if an event triggers a cache write while TotalDocs iterates the cache map, the process can panic with 'concurrent map iteration and map write' during startup because bleveBackend.TotalDocs iterates over the cache map without any lock while BuildIndex writes to the same map": 0.8612242341041565}